+// cursorBuiltinToolNames are the tools Cursor's own agent harness registers on
+// every run, obtained by asking a run carrying no client tools to enumerate
+// what it has. A client tool sharing one of these names is the only kind that
+// has to be renamed, and getting the list wrong is not a soft failure: a
